<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:34:45 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>随着克里姆林宫筹集战争资金，俄罗斯正遭受缓慢的银行挤兑，而且它也可能开始招募军队新兵</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/russia-economy-bank-run-deposit-withdrawals-war-funding-military-mobilization/</link><description>金融部门存款的流失造成了严重的流动性紧缩，以至于威胁到俄罗斯为其战争提供资金的能力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290473726-e1787521166675.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 23:15:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/russia-economy-bank-run-deposit-withdrawals-war-funding-military-mobilization/</guid></item><item><title>随着特朗普政府准备对伊朗采取经济战措施，高级安全官员发誓要“以地震般的方式”进行报复</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/trump-economic-warfare-iran-sanctions-military-retaliation/</link><description>在美国誓言要实施“前所未有”的经济战和孤立之后，预计财政部长斯科特·贝森特将于周一宣布新措施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279056506-e1787518959934.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 21:09:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/trump-economic-warfare-iran-sanctions-military-retaliation/</guid></item><item><title>贾里德·库什纳作为特朗普的特使与伊朗等对手进行了谈判。现在他正在中期选举前与众议院民主党领袖交谈</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/jared-kushner-trump-envoy-house-democratic-leader-hakeem-jeffries-midterms/</link><description>这是一个信号，表明如果民主党在中期选举中从共和党手中夺取多数控制权，白宫正在寻求与民主党合作的方法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26226028475268_615ee1-e1787517872255.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 20:50:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/jared-kushner-trump-envoy-house-democratic-leader-hakeem-jeffries-midterms/</guid></item><item><title>“这让我心碎”——亚伯拉罕·林肯号航空母舰上的一名水手刚刚发现他的父亲在特朗普的移民镇压中被捕</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/navy-sailor-uss-abraham-lincoln-father-trump-immigration-crackdown/</link><description>约书亚·阿维利斯写道：“我不知道我怎么能在精神上继续每天工作 12 个多小时，因为我知道我的父亲在某个地方，可能会被当作罪犯对待。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26235012135622.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 20:39:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/navy-sailor-uss-abraham-lincoln-father-trump-immigration-crackdown/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗战争可能会持续“到 2027 年”，因为霍尔木兹海峡尚未关闭，导致更多石油泄漏，但局势可能很快就会大幅升级</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/iran-war-outlook-2027-strait-of-hormuz-oil-exports-blockade-oman-corridor-escalation/</link><description>“而如果海峡没有完全关闭，伊朗的影响力就很弱。因此，伊朗有理由升级局势。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9883413-e1787508979937.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 19:59:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/iran-war-outlook-2027-strait-of-hormuz-oil-exports-blockade-oman-corridor-escalation/</guid></item><item><title>汉克表示，委内瑞拉放弃玻利瓦尔并采用美元将是自欧元出现以来最大的货币转变</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/dollarization-venezuela-bolivar-currency-switch-hyperinflation-oil-revenue-debt-steve-hanke/</link><description>“抑制通货膨胀是委内瑞拉恢复稳定的关键，所有其他进展都源于此。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1090638304-e1787435106119.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:11:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/dollarization-venezuela-bolivar-currency-switch-hyperinflation-oil-revenue-debt-steve-hanke/</guid></item><item><title>在地下 60 年之后为云提供动力：Ormat 的地热转向人工智能</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/after-60-years-underground-power-cloud-ormat-ai-pivot/</link><description>Ormat 与 Sage Geosystems 和 SLB 在内华达州启动了两个下一代地热项目。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Edited_Doron-e1787337441808.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 07:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/22/after-60-years-underground-power-cloud-ormat-ai-pivot/</guid></item><item><title>伯里表示，他出售了阿里巴巴，并称其在出售股票之前价格昂贵</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/michael-burry-big-short-alibaba-stock-sale-jd-com-purchase/</link><description>“我计划在一两个月后将大部分内容移回原处。不再是了，”伯里在 Substack 上的一篇帖子中说道。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-498541178-2-e1787507692676.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 17:58:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/michael-burry-big-short-alibaba-stock-sale-jd-com-purchase/</guid></item><item><title>经济学家警告称，财政部最近在债券和货币市场上的举措构成了旨在降低债务成本的“软形式金融抑制”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/treasury-bond-buyback-dollar-yen-currency-markets-financial-repression-us-debt-costs/</link><description>“如果不‘允许’UST的市场价格下调，那么外国投资者持有的UST的外汇价格就必须通过美元贬值来调整。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2277979295-e1787501682676.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 17:22:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/treasury-bond-buyback-dollar-yen-currency-markets-financial-repression-us-debt-costs/</guid></item><item><title>地球上的森林花了 10 万年才从上次气候冲击中恢复——这次的恢复速度快了 10 倍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/forests-recovery-time-climate-warming-fossils/</link><description>5600 万年前的树木化石正试图告诉我们森林需要多长时间才能从极端高温中恢复过来。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291128807-e1787498125297.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 15:17:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/23/forests-recovery-time-climate-warming-fossils/</guid></item></channel></rss>